{
  "id": "dream-interpretation",
  "term": "dream interpretation",
  "definition": "Dream interpretation is the process of working with a person’s dream to explore its possible meaning and gain personal insight. In the counselling context supported here, it may be done in therapy or in structured lay-led groups using guided discussion methods.",
